<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 2 (Godee 16th, Taiwo 87th) Willem II</p>
<p>Tilburg 2 (Van de Berg 11th, Konterman 20th) Halftime 1-2.</p>
<p>Attendance 8,250.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 0 Fortuna Sittard 1 (Roest 79th penalty).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 7,000.</p>
